      "comment": "Hark: The Atlas",
      "content": "A famous pirate ship wrecked near the Eye of Kratti; Jahoda knew it from childhood warnings about Lovisa the Shieldmaiden and Grettir the Lunatic. Its nautical records show Hark stopping Lovisa from beating crew caught gambling. A token leading to Reed Miller's Great Treasure was said to be aboard and, per Ilmari, was later taken by a golden-haired traveler.\n\nTreasure hunters at the wreck claimed a ghost attacked them; it was Hark guarding it.",
